"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819070/extras/16d86855517e74a7f34b3cc0d57b0f86.avif?t=1755306917\" data-has-big width=800 height=59 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore a strange and distorted world as you travel across a broken country alongside your partner.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your journey will be long and grueling</strong> \u2014 filled with danger, mysteries, and mind-bending sci-fi revelations. Immerse yourself in an alien reality where every dream, every frame leaves a lasting mark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819070/extras/d3a0b2c63b624a86c4e8ba44c735e738.poster.avif?t=1755306917\" width=798 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819070/extras/d3a0b2c63b624a86c4e8ba44c735e738.webm?t=1755306917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819070/extras/d3a0b2c63b624a86c4e8ba44c735e738.mp4?t=1755306917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819070/extras/16d86855517e74a7f34b3cc0d57b0f86.avif?t=1755306917\" data-has-big width=800 height=59 /></span>A reimagining of survival mechanics \u2014 it\u2019s no longer about you, it\u2019s about your Energy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Energy is more than just a resource</strong> \u2014 it\u2019s your shield, your damage, your path to survival. Use it to activate abilities, recover health, and even fuel certain types of advanced weaponry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Rifts \u2014 space-warping anomalies \u2014 to instantly restore all core attributes. But be warned: if your Energy hits zero, you\u2019ll be left completely vulnerable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819070/extras/6f8331cb770a1ac1d0bd4baf3faa662f.poster.avif?t=1755306917\" width=798 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819070/extras/6f8331cb770a1ac1d0bd4baf3faa662f.webm?t=1755306917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819070/extras/6f8331cb770a1ac1d0bd4baf3faa662f.mp4?t=1755306917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819070/extras/16d86855517e74a7f34b3cc0d57b0f86.avif?t=1755306917\" data-has-big width=800 height=59 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Unique bosses with multiple paths to victory.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each boss features distinct behavior patterns, multiple phases, and custom mechanics. Battles can often be resolved in more than one way \u2014 through direct damage or by manipulating the environment to your advantage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smart positioning and tactical awareness can lead bosses to inflict heavy damage on themselves by triggering traps or destroying critical structures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every encounter demands observation, adaptability, and skill. <strong>Expect anything from a quick skirmish to a drawn-out fight lasting hours</strong> \u2014 the outcome depends entirely on your approach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819070/extras/1a917de06cfed8a7e8fc8e489095dc7f.poster.avif?t=1755306917\" width=798 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819070/extras/1a917de06cfed8a7e8fc8e489095dc7f.webm?t=1755306917\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819070/extras/1a917de06cfed8a7e8fc8e489095dc7f.mp4?t=1755306917\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3819070/extras/179d3f30f7c416eae8e27a6c29633323.avif?t=1755306917\" data-has-big width=800 height=59 /></span></p>",
